OL,3,GNEWSALondon Fire Brigade to return to
OL,4,Ahistoric HQ
OL,5,
OL,6,FLondon Fire Brigade (LFB) will return
OL,7,Fto its historic headquarters on Albert
OL,8,FEmbankment after receiving planning
OL,9,Fpermission from Lambeth Council.
OL,11,FThe headquarters building, which was
OL,12,Fbuilt in the 1930s, and the control
OL,13,Froom extension added in the 1980s will
OL,14,Fbe refurbished.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
