OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1791302151
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALondon Fire Brigade to return to
OL,4,Ahistoric HQ
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe existing Lambeth fire station on
OL,7,Fthe ground and first floor will be
OL,8,Fmodernised and refitted, and the
OL,9,Fbuilding's vacant office space will
OL,10,Fbecome the LFB's headquarters. The site
OL,11,Fwill also contain a space dedicated to
OL,12,Fthe brigade's history that will be open
OL,13,Fto visitors.
OL,15,FLFB commissioner Jonathan Smith said
OL,16,Fthe move was a "historic occasion for
OL,17,Fthe brigade".
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
